From 9e97b9461eb36059e67476a4767915644c327e03 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:48:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Consult: only reason for visit and diagnosis required

The visit form asked for too much. Now:
- Required: reason for visit, and a diagnosis (tick existing or add new).
- Optional notes box; vitals, and symptoms and examination, folded away
  and saved only when filled in. A body part ticked but left empty is
  treated as not examined instead of an error.
- Triage priority and visit type removed; visit type is "new problem"
  when a new diagnosis is added, otherwise "follow-up".
- A visit with no notes gets "<reason>. Assessment: <diagnoses>." as its
  searchable note.
- Record page shows only the vitals that were recorded.

MongoDB: the encounters validator now requires only recordedAt and
chiefComplaint in triage (vitals still range-checked when present).
medsafety_setup_mongo.js is updated; update_encounters_validator.js
applies the same change to an existing database without resetting it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0179Vc7ez9xRGx1SnzaUMPWZ
